'''Pidgeot''' (Japanese: '''ピジョット''' ''Pigeot'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

