==Trivia==
The standard print of this card is part of a narrative illustration with {{TCG ID|Genetic Apex|Pidgey|186}} and {{TCG ID|Genetic Apex|Pidgeotto|187}} from the same set. In this illustration, a Pidgeot now perches on a tree branch between the Pidgeotto and two Pidgey from the previous cards. All three cards are illustrated by [[Scav]] and form the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion's "Pidgey Squad" [[Genetic Apex (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]].

===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Pidgeot}}.
*'''Drive Off''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared on {{TCG ID|XY|Swellow|103}} from the {{TCG|XY}} expansion.
*{{m|Wing Attack}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Pidgeot}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|X}}.

